Aerie-Purpose: Size the horizontal tabs from the size-hz tokens and show only the icon on a tab narrower than 72.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/tabs (tab_style.cc, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/common (tab_view_horizontal_layout.cc, BUILD.gn)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #186. Tab width, minimum widths and the flare radius come from aerie::tokens size-hz-*. The icon-only rule is aerie_sidebar::ShowsIconOnly.

